store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766620/extras/0a13fee48a1c730f633142f8d2a12889.mp4?t=1715533598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Creative Use of Mechanics<br>The control may looks simple. But there is probably a lot deeper than you think. Apart from how well can you control it to do platforming. It is almost also a puzzle game for the way of progressing through level with the mechanics you have on your hand.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766620/extras/8726e902a2bccdd670f5561ce991e46d.poster.avif?t=1715533598\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766620/extras/8726e902a2bccdd670f5561ce991e46d.webm?t=1715533598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766620/extras/8726e902a2bccdd670f5561ce991e46d.mp4?t=1715533598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Credit:<br>Featuring Music by Matthew Pablo<br><br><br>Featuring Music by The Cynic Project<br>",
